<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Actel raised -- source.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Actel raised -- source.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Needham and Co upgraded Actel Corp to buy from hold, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/4 at 19-3/4.</p>
</text>
